        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana Grade 2 Commercial Latch</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deltana Grade 2 Latch is a replacement latch for passage, privacy, or entry function commercial levers. Available with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset in your choice of Brushed Chrome, Polished Brass and Oil Rubbed Bronze finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-G2RLE238-specifications.jpg?v=1704354774\" width=\"600\" height=\"198\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana G2RLE specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Deltana Grade 2 Latch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Latch Plate Overall Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Plate Length Center to Center: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Plate Width, 2-3/4\" Backset: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Plate Width, 2-3/8\" Backset: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Throw: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
